# Model artifacts, evaluation reports and the knowledge index are verified by
# SHA-256 against hashes recorded when they were built. Store them byte-for-byte
# so a Linux deployment checks out exactly the bytes that were evaluated on Windows
# (without this, core.autocrlf rewrites CRLF to LF and every hash check fails).
trained_models/** -text
data/processed/knowledge_index/** -text
*.joblib binary
